# LF everywhere, on every platform. Windows runners check out with
# core.autocrlf=true, which turned every guide page into "# rule-id\r\n":
# the embedded guide changed bytes by platform, and TestEveryRuleHasAGuide
# failed on the first Windows CI run. Fixtures carry line numbers that
# findings are asserted against, so they must not change either.
* text=auto eol=lf
